Dear Loan Servicing Team,

I am writing to request information regarding the secured homeowner loan product. I have the following questions:
1. What is the current rate of interest for this product?;
2. Are there any fees associated with the loan?;
3. What are the minimum and maximum loan values?;
4. What type of security is required?;
5. Are there any limitations on the use of the loan proceeds?;

I would appreciate it if you could provide me with a detailed breakdown of the loan conditions. Thank you,

Sincerely,
Emily Wilson
123 High Street, Manchester M1 3AH
wilsonemily@gmail.com
